{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "aedffdbc-153a-8397-9935-e1283743c22d",
  "created_at": "2026-02-12T09:20:27-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Yuki Okafor",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:14:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Newport Utilities billing, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:14:53-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. Sorry, I'm whispering. Somebody's asleep in the next room. I just bought a house and the first water and sewer bill came, and it's in the old owner's name."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:15:06-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that happens a lot with a recent sale. Can you give me the service address, or the account number from the top of the bill?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:15:17-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, I'd rather not say the address on this call. I've got the account number though. It's, hold on, [pause] it's on the top right. Two, two, seven, zero, four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:15:30-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two two seven zero four. Thank you, I have it. I see the account, and it still lists the previous owner's name. The closing was recent, so the name hasn't been transferred yet. Do you have the date you took ownership?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:15:47-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Late January. The twenty-eighth, I think. So why am I getting a bill with his name on it for stuff before that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:15:56-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me look at the billing period. The bill covers a stretch that begins before your closing date, so part of it may belong to the seller. Normally that gets settled at closing, but I can't see that from here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:16:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. So I'm paying for his water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:16:16-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Possibly part of it, yes. That's why I'd suggest a dispute on the record if you believe the dates are wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:16:25-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Can you email me a duplicate copy of the bill first? I lost the envelope part and the paper's kind of crumpled."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:16:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. What email address would you like it sent to? Spell it slowly for me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:16:42-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, one sec, I'm going to step out of the room. [pause] Okay. Can I just give it to you here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:16:51-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:16:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's Yuki, Y-U-K-I, dot, okafor, O-K-A-F-O-R, at a mail service. I'll say it. At, M-A-I-L, dot com."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:17:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me read that back. Yuki dot Okafor at mail dot com. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:17:08-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. That's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:17:10-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I'll send the duplicate to that address today. It should arrive within the hour or so."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:17:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Now how do I dispute it formally? Like on paper, not just talking to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:17:25-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You'd send a written request to the billing office. Include the account number, your closing date, a copy of the closing paperwork showing the transfer, and a short explanation of what you're disputing. You can mail it or bring it to City Hall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:17:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And the bill stays unpaid while that's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:17:47-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't promise how a dispute affects the due date. What I can say is that you can pay the portion you agree is yours, and the office will review the rest. Would you like to know what the balance shows right now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:18:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. What is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:18:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The current balance is eighty-eight dollars and forty cents."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:18:12-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Fine. I'll just pay it now, it's not worth the late notice. I'll dispute after. Can I do a card with you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:18:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I can take that. Go ahead with the card number whenever you're ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:18:28-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Slowly. Four, zero, one, two. [pause] Eight, eight, eight, eight. Eight, eight, eight, eight. One, eight, eight, one. Expiration is zero five, thirty."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:18:38-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Let me read that back to make sure I have it. Four zero one two, eight eight eight eight, eight eight eight eight, one eight eight one, expiring zero five slash thirty. Is that correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:18:53-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:18:55-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And that's for eighty-eight dollars and forty cents. Do you have the three-digit security code on the back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:19:03-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hang on, I've got to get the card out. [pause] Okay, it's seven, seven, three."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:19:10-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. One moment while I process it. [pause] That went through. You'll get a confirmation number now. It's the letters PR and then four, one, nine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:19:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "P, R, four one nine. Okay. I'm writing it on my hand, sorry. Pen's dead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:19:28-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I'll also put a note on the account that a name change is pending and that a dispute may follow, so whoever reads it sees the context."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:19:40-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I don't want this to bounce around again. I'm a little annoyed it even got here with his name on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:19:49-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understandable. Once you send the closing paperwork, the account name gets updated and the next bill should come to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:19:58-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Sorry, I've got to go, I think I hear somebody up. I'm usually at my card table at the shop on weekends anyway, I trade baseball cards, so I'll drop the paperwork off Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:20:13-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. City Hall billing is open on weekdays, so Monday is fine. Anything else I can help with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:20:21-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T09:20:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care."
    }
  ],
